@startuml cu30
!theme plain
title CU30 — Ingresar nuevo estado de Gestión

actor "Escribano" as Actor
participant "Notaire system" as System

Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) decides to register a new management status.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Asks for the status name and notes.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) enters the new status name and notes.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Records the new status.
System -> System : System

